# libFuzzer dictionary for the ingestion target. Tokens that matter in an OOXML package: ZIP
# record signatures, the part names the engine and the SDK look up, content types, and XML
# constructs. They only help where an entry is stored uncompressed, which is why the seed
# builder writes a stored copy of every fixture.

